**Goal:** Decouple StayAssist rate-limiting from Authentik's internal Redis.

**Current State:**
- [rate-limit.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/lib/rate-limit.ts) L4: `redis://localhost:6379` — connects to Authentik's Redis
- [rate-limit-acknowledge.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/lib/rate-limit-acknowledge.ts) L12: same pattern

**Changes:**
1. **[NEW]** `docker-compose.stayassist.yml` — `stayassist-redis` on port 6380, password-protected, 128MB max, LRU eviction
2. **[MODIFY]** `.env` — add `REDIS_URL`, `REDIS_PASSWORD`
3. **[MODIFY]** `src/lib/rate-limit.ts` — new URL (6380), `lazyConnect`, fail-open catch
4. **[MODIFY]** `src/lib/rate-limit-acknowledge.ts` — same changes

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] `docker ps` shows `stayassist-redis` on port 6380
- [ ] Stopping Authentik Redis does NOT crash intake API
- [ ] Rate limiting still blocks >2 complaints/min/patient when Redis is healthy

