### A.2: Centralized Auth Guard — `auth-guard.ts`
**Goal:** Replace 60+ lines of duplicated auth boilerplate across 6 files with a single composable guard utility. Enforce `is_active` DB check, role verification, and MFA assurance in one place.

**Current State — Auth boilerplate duplicated in 6 files:**
- [complaints.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/actions/complaints.ts) L29–53 — creates client, calls getSession, extracts role
- [audit.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/actions/audit.ts) L13–38 — same pattern
- [sla.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/actions/sla.ts) L27–49 — same pattern
- [workflow.ts](file:///c:/Application%20V4.0/src/actions/workflow.ts) — same pattern
- No file checks `is_active` or MFA AAL level in Server Actions

**Changes:**
1. **[NEW]** `src/lib/auth-guard.ts` — centralized module exporting:
   - `createAuthenticatedClient()` — creates user-scoped Supabase client from cookies
   - `requireUser()` — session + `is_active` DB check → returns `AuthenticatedUser`
   - `requireRole(allowedRoles)` — above + role verification
   - `requireMfa()` — above + AAL2 check
   - `requirePrivileged(allowedRoles)` — role + MFA combined
   - `AuthError` class with typed error codes (`UNAUTHORIZED`, `FORBIDDEN`, `DEACTIVATED`, `MFA_REQUIRED`)
2. **[NEW]** SQL migration `029_add_is_active_column.sql` — add `is_active BOOLEAN DEFAULT true` to `users`
3. **[MODIFY]** `.env` — set `JWT_EXPIRY=1800` (30 minutes)
4. **[MODIFY]** `actions/complaints.ts` — replace 12-line boilerplate with `const user = await requireUser()`
5. **[MODIFY]** `actions/audit.ts` — same replacement
6. **[MODIFY]** `actions/sla.ts` — replace with `const user = await requireRole(['Admin'])`
7. **[MODIFY]** `actions/workflow.ts` — replace with `requireUser()`

**Acceptance Criteria:**
- [ ] Setting `is_active = false` blocks PHI access with "Account deactivated"
- [ ] All Server Actions use `auth-guard.ts` — zero raw `getSession()` calls in actions
- [ ] Active users experience no disruption from JWT auto-refresh

